      "content": "thanks for that. it's a solid start, but honestly, it feels a bit short for what we need for the library. the score for that one was pretty low compared to what we're aiming for in the \"deep dive\" section.\n\ncould you expand on this? i want you to really go into the mathematical derivation or at least the wave-packet interpretation in much greater detail. give me a massive, exhaustive explanation that covers every possible angle of why this principle exists. again, please don't just pad it with junk, but i really need that length to be much higher to meet our library's thoroughness threshold.",
